P('1.1-02-M01','Explain why repeated timings should refer to the same unchanged motion before a mean is used.','They should estimate the same physical time. Changing the motion would mix different quantities rather than simply reduce random variation.',2,'One mark for identifying a common quantity; one for the consequence of mixing unlike conditions.')
